{"content": "1|//! The taste layer (spec §5) — parsed `behaviors.toml`.
2|//!
3|//! This is the "abstraction of the abstraction": a declarative assignment of
4|//! contract state to crab behavior. The renderer and the Phase-0 simulator
5|//! both consume a `Behaviors` value, so taste and code can never drift apart.
6|//! Unknown keys degrade gracefully (default behavior `wait`, default tint) —
7|//! a taste change never crashes the terrarium.
8|
9|use serde::Deserialize;
