{"content": "1|//! Headless render tests for IsometricView.
2|//!
3|//! These convert visual verification into machine-checkable assertions so small models
4|//! have a regression net when editing the render path. The contract layer has 21 tests;
5|//! this adds coverage for ui.rs and iso.rs, which previously had zero #[cfg(test)].
6|
7|#[cfg(test)]
8|mod tests {
9|    use crate::contract::Run;
10|    use crate::mapping::Behaviors;
11|    use crate::simulator::{self};
12|    use ratatui::buffer::Buffer;
